				"name": "Echoing Flames",
				"riotSummary": "Urgot's basic attacks and Purge periodically trigger blasts of flame from his legs, dealing physical damage.",
				"riotTooltip": "",
				"wikiDescription": "Innate: Urgot's six legs each conceal a shotgun that covers an arc, together forming a full circle of cover around him. Each shotgun can fire once before incurring a unique cooldown.\n\nUrgot's next basic attack on-hit within the arc of a shotgun will cause it to fire in a cone, dealing 40% – 100% (based on level) AD (+ 2% – 6% (based on level) of target's maximum health) physical damage to enemies hit, capped at 100 – 390.59 (based on level) against monsters.",
				"leveling": [],
