				"riotSummary": "Miss Fortune fires a bullet at an enemy, damaging them and a target behind them. Both strikes can also apply Love Tap.",
				"riotTooltip": "Miss Fortune fires a bouncing shot, dealing <physicalDamage>{{ totaldamagetooltip }} physical damage</physicalDamage> to an enemy and to another one behind them. <br /><br />The second shot can critically strike for <physicalDamage>{{ totaldamagecrit }} physical damage</physicalDamage>. It always critically strikes if the first shot kills its target.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}",
				"wikiDescription": "Active: Miss Fortune fires a shot at the target enemy that deals physical damage and bounces to hit another enemy behind them, applying on-attack effects to the primary target and on-hit effects to both enemies hit.\n\nDouble Up's bounce can critically strike for「 (150% + 15%) damage. 」「 50% bonus critical damage. 」If Double Up kills the primary target, the bounce will critically strike.\n\nThe bounce prioritizes units directly behind the primary target. A target does not have to be visible to be hit by the bounce.",
