				"name": "Demon Shade",
				"riotSummary": "When out of combat, Evelynn enters Demon Shade. Demon Shade heals Evelynn when she is low on health and grants Camouflage after level 6.",
				"riotTooltip": "",
				"wikiDescription": "Innate: Evelynn shrouds herself in Demon Shade after not performing actions that break stealth for 4 seconds. Attacking or casting abilities ends Demon Shade immediately and places it on a 4-second static cooldown, reduced to 1.25 seconds from casting Last Caress. Taking damage from champions or turrets interrupts Demon Shade and places it on a 1.5-second static cooldown.\n\nDemon Shade: While below 250 – 590 (based on level) (+ 250% AP) health, Evelynn heals herself for 15 – 150 (based on level) every second. From level 6 onward, Demon Shade also grants camouflage.",
