				"riotSummary": "Rammus goes into a defensive formation, vastly increasing his Armor and Magic Resistance, and returning damage to enemies that attack him.",
				"riotTooltip": "Rammus enters a defensive formation for {{ buffduration }} seconds, gaining <scaleArmor>{{ bonusarmortooltip }} Armor</scaleArmor> and <scaleMR>{{ bonusmrtooltip }} Magic Resist</scaleMR> and dealing <magicDamage>{{ returndamagecalc }} magic damage</magicDamage> to enemies that Attack him.<br /><br /><recast>Recast</recast>: Rammus ends this Ability early.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}",
				"wikiDescription": "Active: Rammus enters a defensive stance for 7 seconds, gaining bonus armor and bonus magic resistance. While active, enemies that use a basic attack on-hit against Rammus are dealt 15 (+ 10% total armor) (+ 10% total magic resistance) magic damage.\n\nDefensive Ball Curl can be recast after 1 second within the duration, and does so automatically upon casting Powerball or Soaring Slam.\n\nRecast: Rammus ends Defensive Ball Curl.",
