				"riotTooltip": "Anivia summons a wall of ice {{ wallwidth }} units wide. The wall lasts for {{ wallduration }} seconds before it melts.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}",
				"wikiDescription": "Active: Anivia summons a wall of ice at the target location perpendicular to her facing, knocking all units away from it, though not through terrain. The wall lingers as impassable terrain for 5 seconds.",
