					"This ability is disabled while grounded or rooted even if Elise is in the range in which she does not dash.",
					"If Elise is allowed to dash, Venomous Bite can be used to cross sufficiently thin terrain.",
					"Spiderlings can cross walls and terrain to reach Venomous Bite's target and will attack provided Elise stays within their leash range.",
