				"riotSummary": "Heimerdinger lays down a rapid-fire cannon turret equipped with a secondary pass-through beam attack (turrets deal half damage to towers).",
				"riotTooltip": "Heimerdinger constructs a <keywordMajor>Turret</keywordMajor> that attacks nearby enemies. Heimerdinger can have {{ maxturrets }} turrets active at once. <keywordMajor>Turrets</keywordMajor> slowly build up charge. At max charge, they fire a stronger attack.<br /><br />If Heimerdinger gets too far away, his <keywordMajor>Turrets</keywordMajor> will deactivate after 8 seconds.<br /><br />This Ability has {{ maxkits }} charges.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}",
