				"wikiDescription": "Passive: Pantheon gains armor penetration.\n\nActive: Pantheon channels for 2 seconds before leaping into the sky, causing him to vanish and become immune to crowd control. He continues channeling for 2.25 seconds and grants sight around the target location 0.5 seconds into the channel.\n\nAfter 0.8 seconds into the channel, Pantheon hurls his spear to the target location over 0.2 seconds that deals 40 – 190 (based on Comet Spear's rank) (+ 115% bonus AD) (+ 50% AP) physical damage to enemies near the impact and slows them by 50% for 2 seconds.\n\nOver the remaining 1.25 seconds, Pantheon crashes down after 0.55 seconds and creates a shockwave alongside himself that travels toward the target location over 0.7 seconds, dealing magic damage to enemies hit, reduced by up to 50% for those hit at the edge of the area. Upon completion of the channel, Pantheon will lose the crowd control immunity and reappear at the target location, as well as gain maximum stacks of Mortal Will.",
