				"name": "New Destiny",
				"riotSummary": "Graves' shotgun has some unique properties. He must reload when he runs out of ammo. Attacks fire 4 bullets, which cannot pass through units. Non-champions struck by multiple bullets are knocked back.",
				"riotTooltip": "",
				"wikiDescription": "Innate - Double Barrel: Graves' basic attacks fire his shotgun to consume ammunition within 2 shells. He will reload over a few seconds immediately after expending all shells, or after withholding a leftover shell for a while. The reload time is reduced by Graves' level and bonus attack speed, and is cancelled if Graves reloads a shell with Quickdraw or expends a leftover shell. Graves is unable to declare basic attacks during the reload time if he has expended all shells.\n\nInnate - 12-Gauge: Graves' basic attack sprays 4 pellets in a cone, each colliding with the first enemy unit in their path, dealing 70% – 100.01% (based on level) AD physical damage plus「 23.31% – 33.3% (based on level) AD additional physical damage 」「 about one-third of the damage 」for each subsequent pellet hitting the same target, up to 139.93% – 199.92% (based on level) AD total physical damage against a single target. Pellets deal 25% reduced damage against structures.\n\nCritical strikes spray 6 pellets over a 25% wider cone, with each pellet dealing「 (50% + 15%) increased damage, 」「 increased damage equal to 50% bonus critical damage, 」resulting in「 199.976% (+ 19.998%) total damage 」「 279.84% – 399.79% (based on level) (+ 27.98% – 39.98% (based on level)) AD total physical damage 」if all pellets hit a single target.\n\nPellets apply life steal. Only the first pellet to hit each enemy applies on-hit effects.",
				"leveling": [],
				"cooldown": "",
				"cost": "",
				"costType": "",
				"targetRange": "425",
				"castTime": "",
				"effectRadius": "",
				"width": "40",
