				"riotSummary": "Fizz hops into the air, landing gracefully upon his spear and becoming untargetable. From this position, Fizz can either slam the ground or choose to jump again before smashing back down.",
				"riotTooltip": "Fizz hops onto his trident, becoming Untargetable for 0.75 seconds, after which he deals <magicDamage>{{ edamage }} magic damage</magicDamage> to nearby enemies and <status>Slows</status> them by {{ slowamount*100 }}% for {{ slowduration }} seconds. <br /><br />Fizz can <recast>Recast</recast> this Ability while Untargetable to dash again, which ends the effect early, deals damage in a smaller area, and doesn't <status>Slow</status>.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}",
				"wikiDescription": "Active: Fizz dashes to the target location while becoming untargetable, balancing on his trident for 0.75 seconds, during which he can cast Trickster after 0.15 seconds into the duration.\n\nHe then begins to hop off of his trident over 0.5 seconds, during which he gains 50% bonus movement speed, and afterwards becoming targetable and landing to create a splash that deals magic damage to nearby enemies and slows them for 2 seconds.\n\nWhile hopping off of the trident, Fizz may input movement commands to direct his landing.",
