				"name": "Living Vengeance",
				"riotSummary": "On kill or assist, Varus temporarily gains Attack Damage and Ability Power. This bonus is larger if the enemy is a champion.",
				"riotTooltip": "",
				"wikiDescription": "Innate: When Varus kills an enemy, he gains 10% / 15% / 20% (based on level) bonus attack speed as well as bonus attack damage and ability power equal to 11% of his total bonus attack speed for 5 / 7 / 9 / 11 (based on level) seconds, refreshing on subsequent unit kills.\n\nVarus also gains Living Vengeance's bonuses upon scoring a champion takedown, which empowers it for the same duration to grant him 30% bonus attack speed as well as bonus attack damage and ability power equal to 33% of his total bonus attack speed, and an increased attack speed cap of 3.33. Living Vengeance's empowerment may only be refreshed by subsequent champion takedowns.",
				"leveling": [],
