				"wikiDescription": "Active: Hecarim surrounds himself with the Spirit of Dread for 4 seconds, dealing magic damage every second to nearby enemies.\n\nWhile active, Hecarim gains bonus armor and bonus magic resistance and is healed for 25% of the post-mitigation damage dealt to enemies within the area from all sources, halved to 12.5% for damage dealt by allies. The healing is capped against minions and monsters.",
