				"wikiDescription": "Active: Zac charges for up to 4.5 seconds to increase Elastic Slingshot's range over a cone in the target direction.\n\nElastic Slingshot can be recast within the duration. If Zac cancels the channel himself, or the charge completes without reactivation, 50% of Elastic Slingshot's health cost and cooldown are refunded.\n\nRecast: Zac leaps to the target location within the boundaries of the cone. Upon landing, he deals magic damage to nearby enemies and knocks them up and stuns them for 0.5 seconds, increased to 1 second if Elastic Slingshot was charged for more than 1 second.",
