				"riotTooltip": "",
				"wikiDescription": "Innate: Bel'Veth is allowed to exceed the attack speed cap. Her attack speed does not increase through growth (per level).\n\nInnate: Bel'Veth's ability casts grant her ghosting and 20% bonus attack speed for 3 seconds, refreshing on subsequent casts.\n\nInnate: Whenever Bel'Veth scores a takedown against a champion, monster, or large minion within 3 seconds of damaging them, she generates a permanent stack of Lavender. Large minions and monsters generate 1 stack, champions and epic monsters generate 2 stacks.\nLavender: For each stack, Bel'Veth gains 0.1% – 2% (based on level) bonus attack speed.",
