				"slot": "E",
				"name": "Royal Maelstrom",
				"riotSummary": "Bel'Veth roots herself in place, channeling a storm of slashes around her that targets the lowest-health enemy and grants her lifesteal and damage reduction.",
				"riotTooltip": "Bel'Veth channels and slashes around herself, gaining {{ drpercent*100 }}% Damage Reduction, {{ totallifesteal }} Life Steal, and Attacking {{ f2.0 }} times over {{ totalduration }} seconds with the number of Attacks increasing based on her <attackSpeed>Attack Speed</attackSpeed>. Each Attack strikes the lowest-health enemy, dealing <physicalDamage>{{ damageperstrike }}</physicalDamage> to <physicalDamage>{{ maxdamageperstriketooltip }} physical damage</physicalDamage> based on the target's missing Health.<br /><br />Using another Ability or <recast>Recasting</recast> ends this Ability early.<br />{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}",
				"wikiDescription": "Active: Bel'Veth enters a frenzy for 1.5 seconds, during which she is unable to move, but gains damage reduction and life steal.\n\nWhile active, she rapidly slashes at the nearest enemy with the lowest current health percentage for up to 6 (+ 1 per 40% bonus attack speed) times over the duration. Each slash deals physical damage, increased by 0% – 100% (based on target's missing health), and applies on-hit, on-attack, and spell effects, with on-hit and on-attack damage reduced to 12% – 24% (based on target's missing health) effectiveness. Bel'Veth cannot perform slashes while she is affected by cast-inhibiting crowd control.\n\nRoyal Maelstrom deals 200% damage to monsters, applies life steal, and is affected by critical strike modifiers.\n\nRoyal Maelstrom can be recast after 0.75 seconds within the duration, and does so automatically after the duration or when Bel'Veth casts an ability.",
