				"riotTooltip": "Braum raises his shield for {{ shieldholdduration }} seconds, intercepting enemy missiles from the chosen direction, causing them to hit Braum and then be destroyed. The first missile Braum blocks deals no damage, and subsequent projectiles deal {{ shieldfacingdramount }}% reduced damage.<br /><br />Braum gains <speed>{{ movespeedpercent }}% Move Speed</speed> while his shield is raised.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}",
				"wikiDescription": "Active: Braum sets his shield in the target direction for a duration, creating a barrier in front of him that intercepts all incoming hostile projectiles and reduces the damage Braum takes through it from enemies in the target direction. The first instance of damage dealt by a champion from this direction is reduced by 100%. Unbreakable does not affect turrets.\n\nWhile his shield is raised, Braum also gains 10% bonus movement speed and ghosting.",
