				"riotSummary": "Lamb fires a carefully placed shot, slowing the target. If Lamb attacks the target two more times, her third attack instead directs Wolf to pounce on the enemy, savaging them for massive damage.",
				"riotTooltip": "Kindred weakens an enemy, <status>Slowing</status> them by {{ totalslow }}% for {{ slowduration }} second.<br /><br />Kindred's third Attack against the target within {{ totalduration }} seconds of each other directs Wolf to pounce on the enemy, dealing an additional <physicalDamage>{{ basebitedamage }}</physicalDamage> plus <physicalDamage>{{ percentbitedamage }} missing Health physical damage</physicalDamage>.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}",
				"wikiDescription": "Active: Lamb fires a shot at the target enemy that slows them by 30% (+ 5% per 100 AP) for 1 second and marks them for 4 seconds. Her basic attacks against the marked target each apply a stack, refreshing the duration and stacking up to 3 times.\n\nThe third stack directs Wolf to pounce on the target, consuming all stacks to deal additional physical damage, increased by 0% – 50% (+ 0% – 15%) (based on critical strike chance).\n\nThe damage based on the missing health ratio is capped at 200 against monsters.",
