				"wikiDescription": "Innate: Tahm Kench's basic attacks on-hit and Tongue Lash are empowered to deal 5 – 60 (based on level) (+ 1.25% AP per 100 bonus health) (+ 4% of his bonus health) bonus magic damage and apply a stack of An Acquired Taste against enemy champions for 5 seconds, refreshing on subsequent hits and stacking up to 3 times. Stacks expire one by one every 0.67 seconds when the duration ends.\n\nTongue Lash and Devour gain additional effects against enemies with 3 stacks, consuming them all.",
