				"wikiDescription": "Active: Viego gains displacement immunity over the cast time, then blinks to the target location. Upon arrival, he strikes the most wounded enemy champion nearby, dealing physical damage, slowing them by 99% for 0.25 seconds, and applying on-hit effects. Other nearby enemies are knocked back up to 400-units away based on proximity, though not through terrain.\n\nAll targets hit are dealt 120% AD physical damage, increased by 0% – 70% (+ 0% – 21%) (based on critical strike chance).\n\nIf a Possession is discarded, Heartbreaker will be placed on a 1.5-second cooldown if it is not already on cooldown.",
