				"slot": "P",
				"name": "Contempt for the Weak",
				"riotSummary": "Zed's basic attacks against low health targets deals bonus Magic Damage. This effect can only occur once every few seconds against the same enemy champion.",
				"riotTooltip": "",
				"wikiDescription": "Innate: Zed's basic attacks on-hit against targets below 50% maximum health are empowered to deal 5% / 7.5% / 10% (based on level) of the target's maximum health as bonus magic damage.\n\nAgainst monsters, Contempt for the Weak deals 75% damage and is capped at 175.\n\nContempt for the Weak cannot occur on the same champion more than once every few seconds.",
