				"wikiDescription": "Active: Vi singles out the target enemy champion, dashing with displacement immunity towards them and revealing them. Upon approaching within 300 units of the target, she dashes through and grabs them over 1.05 seconds, knocking them up for 1.3 seconds and dealing physical damage after 0.75 seconds into the grab duration.\n\nEnemies she dashes through are dealt the same damage, knocked aside by 350 units over 0.25 seconds, and stunned for 0.75 seconds.",
