				"name": "Unburrow",
				"riotSummary": "",
				"riotTooltip": "",
				"wikiDescription": "Active: Rek'Sai becomes Un-Burrowed, gaining access to her Un-Burrowed abilities and emerging from the ground to deal magic damage to nearby enemies and knock them up for 1 second. Minions and small monsters are instead knocked back a short distance. Targets hit cannot be displaced by Unburrow again for some time.\n\nRek'Sai can also trigger Unburrow by issuing an attack command, casting the ability once she is in attack range of the target and applying the knock up against them.\n\nRek'Sai becomes unable to move or attack for 0.15 seconds after hitting an enemy with Unburrow.",
