				"riotTooltip": "<spellPassive>Passive: </spellPassive>Kalista's spears linger in their target for 4 seconds, stacking any number of times.<br /><br /><spellActive>Active:</spellActive> Kalista rips the spears from nearby enemies, dealing <physicalDamage>{{ normaldamage }}</physicalDamage> plus <physicalDamage>{{ additionaldamage }} physical damage</physicalDamage> per spear beyond the first. <status>Slows</status> enemies hit by <attention>{{ totalslowamount }}</attention> for {{ slowduration }} seconds.<br /><br />If this Ability kills at least one target, its Cooldown is refreshed and it refunds <scaleMana>{{ manarefund }} Mana</scaleMana>.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}",
				"wikiDescription": "Passive: Kalista's basic attacks on-hit and Pierce apply a stack of Rend to enemies for 4 seconds, refreshing on subsequent hits and stacking up to 254 times per enemy.\n\nActive: Kalista rips out the lodged spears from all nearby enemies afflicted with Rend stacks, consuming the stacks on each target to deal physical damage and slow them for 2 seconds. For each stack beyond the first, the target is dealt additional physical damage. Rend deals 50% damage against epic monsters.\nRend's cast also empowers the in-flight missiles of Kalista's basic attacks and Pierce to apply Rend's effects to their targets immediately upon hitting them.\n\nIf Rend kills at least one target, its cooldown is reset and Kalista restores mana.\n\nA nearby enemy with a Rend stack is required to cast this ability.",
