				"riotTooltip": "Locke throws a binding artifact to a location, dealing <magicDamage>{{ damage }} magic damage</magicDamage> and <status>Slowing</status> enemies in the area by {{ slowamount*100 }}%, decaying over {{ slowduration }} seconds. The artifact marks enemies hit for {{ duration }} seconds, sealing away marked enemy champions brought below <spellName>{{ executetooltipcalc }}</spellName>, and resetting the duration of the mark on other affected champions.<br /><br />After the duration ends, if at least one champion was sealed, the artifact lands on the ground. Locke can pick up the artifact to permanently increase its execution threshold by {{ executethresholdperstack*100 }}%, and refund {{ cooldownreduction }}% of his total Cooldown, for each champion sealed.<br />{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}",
				"wikiDescription": "Active: Locke throws a totem artifact that travels to the target location over 0.5 seconds. After landing for 0.25 seconds, the totem fires latching nails at nearby enemies: dealing magic damage, slowing them by 99% decaying over 2 seconds, revealing them for 1 second, and marking enemy champions hit for 5 seconds. Marked enemies are executed below a portion of their health. Successful executions refresh the mark duration on all affected targets.\n\nOnce all marks expire, and if at least one champion was executed, the totem seals the souls of all executed champions and drops to the ground both over 2.25 seconds. It then lingers for a duration equal to Purgatory's remaining cooldown, but for no less than 10 seconds. Locke can move near the totem to collect it, and for each soul sealed it will both reduce Purgatory's current cooldown by 20% of its total cooldown and grant him a permanent Sealed Champion stack.",
