				"wikiDescription": "Passive: Zaahen gains armor penetration.\n\nActive: Zaahen gains crowd control immunity over the cast time, then launches with displacement immunity into the air to the target location. He then slams his glaive down after a 0.6-second delay, unleashing a shockwave that deals physical damage to nearby enemies and heals him for each champion hit.\n\nZaahen is unable to act and gains 50% damage reduction from the start of the cast time. He retains these effects as well as the displacement immunity during the delay before the slam and for up-to an additional 0.25 seconds afterwards.",
				"leveling": [
					"Armor Penetration: 10 / 20 / 30%",
					"Physical Damage: 250 / 400 / 550 (+ 200% bonus AD)\nHealing per Champion hit: 82.5 / 132 / 181.5 (+ 66% bonus AD)"
				],
